    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ti bathdɔɔri ti kuɔ̱r wi̱cdɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ ŋuaan wi̱cdɛ ŋuaan (144,000)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mɛmɛ cua ja̱a̱k nhial da̱ŋ ŋuan nɛn cuŋä pekni ɣɔaa da̱ŋ ŋuan, gëlkɛ jiɔam wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n da̱ŋ ŋuan jɔk, kɛ ɣöö bɛ thil jiɔam mi put wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n kiɛ bar kiɛ kä jiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jääk nhial dɔ̱diɛn nɛn wëë nhial kä käny ca̱ŋ, kä tëëkɛ thääny Kuɔth in tëk. Kä cuɛ ja̱a̱k nhial da̱ŋ ŋuan tin ca ka̱m buɔ̱m kɛ ɣöö ba wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛnɛ bar däk cɔl kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn jääk cuɛ wee i̱, “/Cuarɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n kiɛ bar kiɛ jiɛn däk, amäni mi wakɔ la̱a̱t Kuɔthda nhiam kaandiɛn wä moc biɛl kɛ thääny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
